# Working notes, kept off a public repository
#
# These are notes to ourselves, not documentation. They carry local paths, device
# serials, phase plans, and running commentary that would only mislead someone
# reading the repo to understand the app. Listing a path here does nothing on its
# own if the file is already tracked -- that is why these sat in the repo for
# several releases despite being listed. They were untracked with
# `git rm --cached` and removed from history.
.agent/
.agents/
.agents/skills/
AGENTS.md
docs/
CLAUDE.md
collaboration-workflow.md

# Everything that is a plan rather than documentation lives here: finished release
# plans, the phase files, device checklists, research and agent prompts. One
# directory so there is a single answer to "is this written for a reader, or for
# us?" -- if it is under .notes/ it is for us and never ships.
.notes/


# Python (dictionary-tools/ build pipeline)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Release signing
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
